{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Afterlife Cafe</i> is a visual novel centered around death and traveling to the afterlife. Meet and chat with your guides at the cafes. Take a trip to the underworld and learn the stories of those who have passed. Stay above ground and juggle friends, work, and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game you can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make beverages at the cafes' self-serve kiosks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the cafe concierges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the afterlife and talk with spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to stay out of the drama at work</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime-inspired character and background art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom soundtrack to guide your journey</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763730?t=1757635745","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763730?t=1757635745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763730/a7ba6e5dbb1fee2d6581932ce7380a13dc9371d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757635745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763730/a7ba6e5dbb1fee2d6581932ce7380a13dc9371d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757635745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Conversation around death is a primary focus of this game. There are no visual depictions\u2014only references by people who may have lost a loved one as well as spirits speaking about their lives in the past tense, sometimes in a carefree and playful manner and other times in a sorrowful manner."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Afterlife Cafe</i> is a visual novel centered around death and traveling to the afterlife. Meet and chat with your guides at the cafes. Take a trip to the underworld and learn the stories of those who have passed. Stay above ground and juggle friends, work, and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game you can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make beverages at the cafes' self-serve kiosks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the cafe concierges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the afterlife and talk with spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to stay out of the drama at work</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime-inspired character and background art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom soundtrack to guide your journey</p></li></ul>","developers":["Guava Pixel Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763730/54f588a39a5200474c3e1532e46eed289e264ab1/header.jpg?t=1757635745","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158583,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158583/movie480.mp4?t=1750934910","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158583/movie_max.mp4?t=1750934910"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158583/e1bab308892da7f8d28cf0ed42f8697c318a47f5/movie_600